:: Sister Sleepy Hallway [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1175,2900","size":"100,100"}
/* Grumpy morning: bring coffee or leave her alone. At higher relation she mumbles something honest. */
<p>I run into $sister.callName in the hallway. Her hair is going in every direction, her eyes are half closed, and she's wearing only one sock.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $sister, text: "Mmgh. No talking until coffee." }
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<br>
<div id="choice1" class="choices">
	<div>
		<<link "Bring her a coffee">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ text: "I make one for her and put it in her hands. She holds it with both of them like a lifeline." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "You're the best. Don't tell anyone I said that." }
				]>>
				<<if $sister.stats.relation >= 40>>
					<<run _msgs.push({ who: $sister, text: either(
						"I dreamed I slept through the exam, and the weird part is that I was almost relieved.",
						"$mom.callName looks so tired all the time lately. I wish I could do more for her.",
						"Don't tell anyone, but I have no idea what I want to do after college.",
						"It's nice having you back home, you know. The house was way too quiet without you."
					) })>>
				<</if>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 2>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Leave her alone">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ text: "I step aside and let her shuffle past." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Smart choice." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "SisterRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Tease her about it">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Rough night? You look like a ghost." },
					{ who: $sister, text: "Keep talking and I'll haunt you for the rest of the day." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
